{"id":"9bd3021c047fb402","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure2 Pushforward Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure — ZFC Measure2 Pushforward Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure","58-df-zfc-measure6-pushforward-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure — ZFC Measure2 Pushforward Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-pushforward-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure2-pushforward-measure — ZFC Measure2 Pushforward Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mu,\\nu,f,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{T}\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mu,\\nu,f,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{T}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2PushforwardMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2PushforwardMeasure}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2PushforwardMeasure}_S(\\nu,f,\\mu,\\mathrm{T})\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,Y,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathrm{T},Y)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{T}\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathrm{T})\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{T}\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(f^{-1}[B]))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2PushforwardMeasure}_S(\\nu,f,\\mu,\\mathrm{T})\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,Y,\\Sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathrm{T},Y)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{T}\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathrm{T})\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{T}\\;(\\nu(B)=\\mu(f^{-1}[B]))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[E]\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\nu(E)=\\mu(f^{-1}[E]))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}pushforward\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6PushforwardMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,f,\\nu)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[E]\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\nu(E)=\\mu(f^{-1}[E]))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The measure6 pushforward-measure variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-funct